        80.61770707376058,
        237.8942159631953,
        576.5191514394976,
        278.934380945012
      ],
      "text": "B_\nis the result of ignorance on the part of the public.\nC\ncould be prevented by the action of ordinary people.\n:\nD_canonly be stopped by educating business leaders.\n"
    },
