        80.25780659575273,
        408.48704253892083,
        576.556992537934,
        467.53160382941195
      ],
      "text": "A_\nMeat packers stopped supplying hamburgers to fast-food chains.\nB_ Afast-food company forced their meat suppliers to follow the law.\n|\nC_\nMeat packers persuaded the government to reduce their expenses.\n|\nDA\nfast-food company encouraged the government to introduce legislation.\n|\n"
